## Codebase Patterns
- PATTERN: Mocker stubs use ProcessorConfiguration, never TransactionData (FB s13#1).
- PATTERN: Runner Storages = `- FileSystem: {Path: ...}` (FB s13#2).
- PATTERN: Transactions require DataSourceNames (FB s13#3).
- PATTERN: HttpStatus = StatusCode + OutputNames list; always pair with HermeticByExpectedOutputCount {ExpectedCount, OutputNames} (FB s13#4, s13#13).
- PATTERN: Runner Route has no leading slash; mocker Endpoint Path keeps it (FB s13#5).
- PATTERN: Mocker docker base = aspnet:10.0 (FB s13#7).
- PATTERN: cd into the PROJECT dir before dotnet run (config resolves vs CWD).

